                        <Value>@0 AutoLCD
center = Welcome! =
echo Please apprise yourself
echo of our server rules. Not
echo reading them isn't an
echo excuse for breaking them.
echo
echo Use the facilities here
echo to make a ship! You have
echo 40,000 PCU to work with.
echo
echo You can also upload a
echo blueprint to workshop
echo (or bp.sbc to a filehost)
echo and use !paste &lt;URL&gt;
echo
echo These projection tables
echo can also be used to 
echo construct ships. viktor
echo please edit this

@1 AutoLCD
center = Server Rules =
echo
echo 1. No bigotry, slurs, or
echo    similar in chat, 
echo    faction names,
echo    and grids.
echo
echo 2. No gravity drives or
echo    piston guns or similar
echo    lag generators
echo
echo 3. Don't back-seat
echo    moderate. Bring
echo    problems with other
echo    players to admins.
echo
echo 4. Have fun! Please, don't
echo    take it too seriously.

@2 AutoLCD
center = Station Processing Status =
Count {G:station - processing}
center = Components on-hand =
InvListX {GT:Cargo} +component
center = Ingots on-hand =
InvListX {GT:Cargo} +ingot</Value>
                      </item>
                    </dictionary>
                  </Storage>
                </Component>
              </ComponentData>
            </Components>
